Multiply-and-Accumulate register, high 32 bits.\nWritten together with MACL by the MAC.W/MAC.L instructions; the S bit in SR selects whether the MACH:MACL pair saturates or wraps on overflow.|Registro Multiply-and-Accumulate, 32 bit alti.\nScritto insieme a MACL dalle istruzioni MAC.W/MAC.L; il bit S di SR stabilisce se la coppia MACH:MACL satura o si riavvolge in caso di overflow.
Multiply-and-Accumulate register, low 32 bits.\nAlso used as an ordinary 32-bit result register by MUL.L, DMULS.L and DMULU.L, which only ever write MACH:MACL.|Registro Multiply-and-Accumulate, 32 bit bassi.\nUsato anche come normale registro risultato a 32 bit da MUL.L, DMULS.L e DMULU.L, che scrivono solo in MACH:MACL.
